---
export const title = 'Keyboard, events and forms';
export const order = 300;
import DemoComponentCard from '../../../../components/DemoComponentCard.astro';
---

<p>
  Each list is a <code>wc-listbox multiple</code>, named by its headline and count ("Selected
  (3)"), so it works as there: <kbd>Up</kbd> and <kbd>Down</kbd> move, <kbd>Space</kbd> or a
  click checks an item, <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>A</kbd> (<kbd>Cmd</kbd>+<kbd>A</kbd>) checks all.
  <kbd>Enter</kbd> moves the focused item to the other list and keeps focus in its list. The move
  buttons are named "Move checked items to Selected", "Move all items to Available" and so on,
  and point the other way in right-to-left layouts. Every move is announced in a polite live
  region, such as "2 items moved to Selected".
</p>
<p>
  Every move or reorder fires one <code>change</code>, which bubbles, with
  <code>detail.value</code> (comma-separated) and <code>detail.values</code>. A move is a commit,
  so there is no separate <code>input</code>. Setting <code>value</code> or
  <code>values</code> from code fires nothing.
</p>
<p>
  Inside a <code>&lt;form&gt;</code> each value is submitted under <code>name</code>.
  <code>required</code> blocks submission while nothing is selected, <code>form.reset()</code>
  restores the first value, <code>readonly</code> shows the lists without letting the person
  move items, and <code>disabled</code> turns everything off.
</p>

<DemoComponentCard lang={'html'}>
  <form id='transfer-list-form' style='width: 100%; max-width: 44rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem;'>
    <wc-transfer-list
      label='Team members'
      name='members'
      required
      options='[{"value":"ana","label":"Ana"},{"value":"ben","label":"Ben"},{"value":"chen","label":"Chen"},{"value":"dara","label":"Dara"}]'
    ></wc-transfer-list>
    <div style='display: flex; gap: 0.5rem;'>
      <wc-button type='submit'>Submit</wc-button>
      <wc-button type='reset' variant='outlined'>Reset</wc-button>
    </div>
  </form>
  <script is:inline>
    document.querySelector('#transfer-list-form').addEventListener('submit', function (event) {
      event.preventDefault();
      myConsole.log('submit', JSON.stringify(new FormData(event.target).getAll('members')));
    });
  </script>
</DemoComponentCard>

<DemoComponentCard lang={'html'}>
  <div style='width: 100%; max-width: 44rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem;'>
    <wc-transfer-list
      label='Read only'
      readonly
      value='ben'
      options='[{"value":"ana","label":"Ana"},{"value":"ben","label":"Ben"}]'
    ></wc-transfer-list>
    <wc-transfer-list
      label='Disabled'
      disabled
      value='ben'
      options='[{"value":"ana","label":"Ana"},{"value":"ben","label":"Ben"}]'
    ></wc-transfer-list>
  </div>
</DemoComponentCard>
